      "text": "NFR-S6 Admin auth & brute-force\nQuality: dashboard APIs not public\nMechanism: JWT/jose session; getAdminFromRequest\nRate limits on login/register (ratelimit.ts)\nJWT_SECRET / LICENSE_SECRET / GITHUB_PAT env-only",
