      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NFR-L2 Idempotent register/validate\nQuality: retries safe (installer re-runs)\nMechanism: register binds once; validate is read+audit write\nNo double-issue of conflicting machine bindings for same policy\nClear messages: not found / inactive / channel misconfig",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NFR-L2 Idempotent register/validate\nQuality: retries safe (installer re-runs)\nMechanism: register binds once; validate is read+audit write\nNo double-issue of conflicting machine bindings for same policy\nClear messages: not found / inactive / channel misconfig",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
