      "text": "NFR-L3 Version awareness\nQuality: entitlement knows what is installed\nMechanism: validate accepts installedVersion; may update license fields\nversion/list separate from download (catalog vs gated bytes)\nAsset pointer returned only after valid=true",
      "fontSize": 13,
