      "locked": false,
      "text": "NFR-L4 Key verify vs validate\nQuality: crypto check distinct from DB entitlement check\nMechanism: license/verify = verifyLicenseKey (HMAC)\nlicense/validate = DB Client+License+channel+history\nBoth required for full commercial confidence",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
