      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NFR-L4 Key verify vs validate\nQuality: crypto check distinct from DB entitlement check\nMechanism: license/verify = verifyLicenseKey (HMAC)\nlicense/validate = DB Client+License+channel+history\nBoth required for full commercial confidence",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
