      "locked": false,
      "text": "NFR-D1 Local-first resilience\nQuality: downloads survive GitHub rate limits when cached\nMechanism: RELEASE_ASSETS_DIR + readLocalFileIfExists / streamLocalFile\nFallback: streamGithubAsset with PAT\ncron/sync-releases warms cache (CRON_SECRET)",
