      "text": "NFR-D2 Chunked transfer integrity\nQuality: large installs work on restrictive networks\nMechanism: meta endpoint then .part-NNN; manifest sha256 + totalBytes\nInstaller reassembles + gzip -t / hash verify\nisValidChunkedManifest rejects corrupt manifests",
