      "text": "NFR-D3 No blobs in Mongo\nQuality: DB stays small; horizontal admin possible\nMechanism: releases on GitHub + optional local disk only\nHistory/ValidationHistory store metadata, not tarballs\nStream responses; do not buffer full artifact in memory",
      "fontSize": 13,
